<title>HONG KONG: Wang On Group year net down 13.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Wang On Group year net down 13.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended March 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   14.8   vs 22.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    3.0    vs 1.0</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    30.02  vs 34.57</p>
<p>    Turnover		     362.16 vs 291.88</p>
<p>    Company name		 Wang On Group Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  September 23-26</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   October 4</p>
<p>NOTE - Provider of decoration and construction services.</p>
<p>Total dividend for year is five H.K. cents (including interim dividend of two cents) vs one cent.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
